# 0.8.0 (VC first, owner 2026-10-26): the visualizer draws on the BCM in
# the release line, through the merged image's overlay (viz-ovl-m.bin;
# visualizer.md 8.5).  The job model takes its ops from the image as the
# device does (bcm_viz ovl on, its default): SPECTRUM, BARS and the line
# ops only once the overlay is loaded in this epoch.  So:
#  start-c0  the view starts on the BCM path with its overlay owed: the
#            art thread reads the file (never the UI thread), the UI's
#            pass puts each piece, the frames hold meanwhile (no CPU
#            draw), then the bars go to the BCM (BARS, 0x34);
#  c0-c1     a cut (a new epoch: the overlay gone, as after a wake or a
#            DECODE's swap into the shared region): held again, loaded
#            again, never the CPU.
# Runs on sim-ui-video (the gate) and on the release-config sim:
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-rel-bcm scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p19-relviz.script
# log: art bcm viz ask base=0012b000 bytes=19380
# log: viz start style=0 path=bcm n=512 owed
# log: viz hold why=owed
# logbetween: start c0 bcmjob overlay load k=0 bytes=19380 at=0012b000
# logbetween: start c0 bcmjob overlay ok ops=01e3bfff
# logbetween: start c0 art bcm viz load pieces=3 res=0
# logbetween: start c0 viz hold end ms=
# logbetween: start c0 bcmjob submit op=0x34
# logbetween: c0 c1 bcmjob overlay load k=0 bytes=19380
# logbetween: c0 c1 art bcm viz load pieces=3 res=0
# logbetween: c0 c1 viz hold end ms=
# logbetween: c0 c1 bcmjob submit op=0x34
# nolog: CPU FALLBACK
# nolog: why=nojob
# nolog: bcmjob overlay refused
# nolog: FAULT bcm viz overlay
# np: viz-full
# reset: viz
wait 3000
play_files /Music/Tone%20Collective/Sine%20Studies/01%20Concert%20A.mp3
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Music
wait 700
key MENU
wait 700
wheel +10           # "Now Playing"
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 1500
key SELECT          # Scrubber
wait 400
key SELECT          # Rating
wait 600
key SELECT          # Shuffle
wait 600
key SELECT          # Visualizer: its overlay owed, then on the BCM
wait 1500
shot bars
ab_mark c0
bcm_fault cut       # a new epoch: the overlay gone
wait 2000
ab_mark c1
shot bars_again
key SELECT          # back to Normal
wait 1200
